# CampusQuest context

2D multiplayer campus explorer for LGS Wah Cantt (Gudwal), adapted from SkyOffice.

## Stack

Phaser 3 + Colyseus + React/Redux + TypeScript + Tiled.

## Non-goals (do not implement)

- PeerJS, video chat, screen share, whiteboards
- Custom/private/password rooms
- User accounts or databases
- Mobile/touch gameplay

## Hard rules

- Campus copy lives in `client/src/content/` (and `docs/CONTENT.md`) — never hardcode in components/scenes
- One map, one `CampusScene`, one Colyseus room `campus`
- Phaser never imports React or touches Redux — use `phaserEvents`
- Update relevant `docs/` in the same change as behaviour
- Read `AGENTS.md` and `docs/DECISIONS.md` before large changes
